  "ui_html": "<div class=\"row justify-content-center text-start pb-7 me-n5\"><div class=\"col-lg-12\"><div class=\"my-7 pt-4 text-center\"><div class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center\"><div class=\"text-medium font-xxlarge-md mb-1 me-3\">Welcome to Zoho Books</div> <a class=\"cursor-pointer ms-2\" href=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/925305392?dnt=1\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg class=\"icon align-middle\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9 16.172A7.172 7.172 0 109 1.828a7.172 7.172 0 000 14.344zm0 1.266A8.438 8.438 0 109 .562a8.438 8.438 0 000 16.876z\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path><path d=\"M12.055 8.221a.9.9 0 010 1.559l-4.05 2.338a.9.9 0 01-1.35-.779V6.662a.9.9 0 011.35-.779l4.05 2.338z\"></path></svg> Overview of Zoho Books</a></div> <div class=\"text-dark-shade-blue font-normal mb-3\">Your journey to effortlessly manage your accounting starts here.</div></div></div> <!-- --> <div class=\"col-lg-9\"><div class=\"row gs-steps-new g-0\"><div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-5\"><div class=\"d-flex p-5 gs-box setup-box rounded white-bg\"><div class=\"pe-5\"><svg data-name=\"Layer 1\" height=\"35px\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"35px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M255.54.44c-141.38 0-256 114.62-256 256s114.62 256 256 256 256-114.61 256-256-114.61-256-256-256zm95.39 339.72a30 30 0 01-30 30H199V370h-8.83a30 30 0 01-30-30V174.73a30 30 0 0130-30h130.76a30 30 0 0130 30z\" fill=\"#ebf7fe\" transform=\"translate(.46 -.44)\"></path><path d=\"M190.16 144.73a30 30 0 00-30 30V340a30 30 0 0030 30H199V144.73z\" fill=\"#22a1bb\" transform=\"translate(.46 -.44)\"></path><path d=\"M320.93 144.73H199v225.43h121.93a30 30 0 0030-30V174.73a30 30 0 00-30-30zm-87.81 141.34a4 4 0 014-4h75.68a4 4 0 014 4v41.76a4 4 0 01-4 4h-75.68a4 4 0 01-4-4z\" fill=\"#7acbdf\" transform=\"translate(.46 -.44)\"></path></svg></div> <div><div class=\"font-medium text-semibold mb-2\">Configure Chart of Accounts</div> <div class=\"text-muted font-small\" style=\"min-height: 98px;\"><div>The Chart of Accounts in Zoho Books contains a list of default accounts that can be used by any type of business. If there are other accounts that your business needs, you can create them. <a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/in/books/help/accountant/chart-of-accounts.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More</a></div> <!-- --><!-- --></div> <div class=\"d-inline-flex mt-4\"><button class=\"ember-view btn btn-sm btn-link badge-status-processing me-4\" data-crawl-id=\"21\" id=\"ember1581\">Configure</button> <a class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xI1V5Q38x3A\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg class=\"icon me-2\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9 16.172A7.172 7.172 0 109 1.828a7.172 7.172 0 000 14.344zm0 1.266A8.438 8.438 0 109 .562a8.438 8.438 0 000 16.876z\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path><path d=\"M12.055 8.221a.9.9 0 010 1.559l-4.05 2.338a.9.9 0 01-1.35-.779V6.662a.9.9 0 011.35-.779l4.05 2.338z\"></path></svg><span>Watch &amp; Learn</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-5\"><div class=\"d-flex p-5 gs-box setup-box rounded white-bg\"><div class=\"pe-5\"><svg data-name=\"Layer 1\" height=\"35px\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"35px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0C114.62 0 0 114.62 0 256s114.62 256 256 256 256-114.62 256-256S397.38 0 256 0zm139.75 218.56v104.88a30 30 0 01-30 30h-219.5a30 30 0 01-30-30V188.56a30 30 0 0130-30h219.5a30 30 0 0130 30z\" fill=\"#ebf8ff\"></path><path d=\"M365.75 158.56h-219.5a30 30 0 00-30 30v30a60 60 0 0060-60h159.5a60 60 0 0060 60v-30a30 30 0 00-30-30zM335.75 353.44h30a30 30 0 0030-30v-30a60 60 0 00-60 60zM116.25 293.44v30a30 30 0 0030 30h30a60 60 0 00-60-60z\" fill=\"#21a0bb\"></path><path d=\"M335.75 158.56h-159.5a60 60 0 01-60 60v74.88a60 60 0 0160 60h159.5a60 60 0 0160-60v-74.88a60 60 0 01-60-60zM256 214.33A41.67 41.67 0 11214.33 256 41.67 41.67 0 01256 214.33z\" fill=\"#79cce0\"></path><circle cx=\"256\" cy=\"256\" fill=\"#fff\" r=\"41.67\"></circle></svg></div> <div><div class=\"font-medium text-semibold mb-2\">Enter Opening Balances</div> <div class=\"text-muted font-small\" style=\"min-height: 98px;\"><div>If you're migrating from another software you must enter the opening balances in Zoho Books before you start creating transactions to keep your books intact. <a href=\"https://www.zoho.com/in/books/help/settings/opening-balances.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Learn More</a></div> <!-- --><!-- --></div> <div class=\"d-inline-flex mt-4\"><button class=\"ember-view btn btn-sm btn-link badge-status-processing me-4\" id=\"ember1582\">Configure</button> <a class=\"d-inline-flex align-items-center\" href=\"https://youtu.be/KvkW4zSDni8?t=376 \" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><svg class=\"icon me-2\" viewbox=\"0 0 18 18\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M9 16.172A7.172 7.172 0 109 1.828a7.172 7.172 0 000 14.344zm0 1.266A8.438 8.438 0 109 .562a8.438 8.438 0 000 16.876z\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path><path d=\"M12.055 8.221a.9.9 0 010 1.559l-4.05 2.338a.9.9 0 01-1.35-.779V6.662a.9.9 0 011.35-.779l4.05 2.338z\"></path></svg><span>Watch &amp; Learn</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-6 mb-5\"><div class=\"d-flex p-5 gs-box setup-box rounded white-bg\"><div class=\"pe-5\"><svg data-name=\"Layer 1\" height=\"35px\" id=\"Layer_1\" viewbox=\"0 0 512 512\" width=\"35px\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 0C114.62 0 0 114.62 0 256s114.62 256 256 256 256-114.62 256-256S397.38 0 256 0zm139.5 200.2v125.6a30.09 30.09 0 01-30 30h-219a30.09 30.09 0 01-30-30V186.2a30.09 30.09 0 0130-30h219a30.09 30.09 0 0130 30z\" fill=\"#ebf8ff\"></path><path d=\"M365.5 156.2h-219a30.09 30.09 0 00-30 30v14h279v-14a30.09 30.09 0 00-30-30zM116.5 325.8a30.09 30.09 0 0030 30h219a30.09 30.09 0 0030-30v-87.71h-279zm193.91-48